('a199ad9a-859c-407f-bfc0-4fcdb261631f', 'a199ad9a-7f81-4ffa-bf89-5c5cd2fc0472', 'Cleaning Supplies', 'cleaning-supplies', 'This eco-friendly cleaning supplies kit features sustainable products that effectively clean your home while being safe for the environment and your family.', 'https://kolzsticks.github.io/Free-Ecommerce-Products-Api/main/images/products/cleaning-supplies.jpg', 0, 1, '2026-04-21 22:29:06', '2026-04-21 22:29:06', 0),
('a199ad9a-8621-447b-8949-85849a07a684', 'a199ad9a-64b8-42e3-b531-0867d9a6760b', 'Health & Fitness', 'health-fitness', 'This Foldable Electric Treadmill offers a convenient way to maintain fitness at home. With various speed settings and a compact design, it\'s perfect for beginners and seasoned athletes.', 'https://kolzsticks.github.io/Free-Ecommerce-Products-Api/main/images/products/treadmill.jpg', 0, 1, '2026-04-21 22:29:06', '2026-04-21 22:29:06', 0),
('a199ad9a-86b3-414b-876d-459518ff135b', 'a199ad9a-8621-447b-8949-85849a07a684', 'Fitness Equipment', 'fitness-equipment', 'This Foldable Electric Treadmill offers a convenient way to maintain fitness at home. With various speed settings and a compact design, it\'s perfect for beginners and seasoned athletes.', 'https://kolzsticks.github.io/Free-Ecommerce-Products-Api/main/images/products/treadmill.jpg', 0, 1, '2026-04-21 22:29:06', '2026-04-21 22:29:06', 0),
('a199ad9a-873b-4682-a810-a79a5be79d2f', 'a199ad9a-8621-447b-8949-85849a07a684', 'Sports Nutrition', 'sports-nutrition', 'This Whey Protein Powder provides an excellent source of protein for muscle recovery and growth. The 2kg package is ideal for athletes and fitness enthusiasts aiming for optimal nutrition.', 'https://kolzsticks.github.io/Free-Ecommerce-Products-Api/main/images/products/protein-powder.jpg', 0, 1, '2026-04-21 22:29:06', '2026-04-21 22:29:06', 0),
('a199ad9a-87c0-4ac3-b6c1-25a881b8416b', 'a199ad9a-8621-447b-8949-85849a07a684', 'Health Monitors', 'health-monitors', 'Stay on top of your health with this Digital Blood Pressure Monitor. Easy to use and highly accurate, it helps you track your blood pressure at home with clear digital readings.', 'https://kolzsticks.github.io/Free-Ecommerce-Products-Api/main/images/products/blood-pressure-monitor.jpg', 0, 1, '2026-04-21 22:29:06', '2026-04-21 22:29:06', 0),
('a199ad9a-8854-4ff4-8baf-ecba5a5bb67b', 'a199ad9a-8621-447b-8949-85849a07a684', 'First Aid', 'first-aid', 'This Compact First Aid Kit is essential for home, travel, or emergency situations. Packed with necessary supplies, it ensures you\'re prepared for minor injuries and emergencies.', 'https://kolzsticks.github.io/Free-Ecommerce-Products-Api/main/images/products/first-aid-kit.jpg', 0, 1, '2026-04-21 22:29:06', '2026-04-21 22:29:06', 0),
('a199ad9a-894b-4352-ba11-9df7bdeb9a10', 'a199ad9a-8621-447b-8949-85849a07a684', 'Personal Health', 'personal-health', 'Keep your hands clean and germ-free with this Alcohol-Based Hand Sanitizer. The 500ml bottle is perfect for personal use at home or on the go, providing effective sanitization.', 'https://kolzsticks.github.io/Free-Ecommerce-Products-Api/main/images/products/hand-sanitizer.jpg', 0, 1, '2026-04-21 22:29:06', '2026-04-21 22:29:06', 0),
('a199ad9a-89e2-4a4c-aaf5-e12cb86c6a9a', 'a199ad9a-8621-447b-8949-85849a07a684', 'Sports Gear & Accessories', 'sports-gear-accessories', 'Enhance your workout experience with these comfortable Workout Gloves. Designed to provide grip and protection, they are perfect for lifting weights or performing rigorous exercises.', 'https://kolzsticks.github.io/Free-Ecommerce-Products-Api/main/images/products/gloves.jpg', 0, 1, '2026-04-21 22:29:06', '2026-04-21 22:29:06', 0),
('a199ad9a-8a66-49f4-88df-42eed07d3d41', 'a199ad9a-8621-447b-8949-85849a07a684', 'Yoga & Meditation Supplies', 'yoga-meditation-supplies', 'The Non-Slip Yoga Mat is designed for stability and comfort during yoga sessions. Its durable material ensures a safe practice, making it ideal for all skill levels and styles.', 'https://kolzsticks.github.io/Free-Ecommerce-Products-Api/main/images/products/yoga-mat.jpg', 0, 1, '2026-04-21 22:29:06', '2026-04-21 22:29:06', 0);
